, "t": 11.628}, {"w": "se", "t": 11.787}, {"w": "protéger", "t": 11.946}, {"w": "!", "t": 12.422}]}, {"id": "s2a", "scene": 2, "text": "La dengue est une maladie virale transmise principalement par la piqûre d'un moustique infecté du genre Aedes.", "start": 13.211, "end": 19.374, "words": [{"w": "La", "t": 13.211}, {"w": "dengue", "t": 13.378}, {"w": "est", "t": 13.711}, {"w": "une", "t": 13.877}, {"w": "maladie", "t": 14.21}, {"w": "virale", "t": 14.71}, {"w": "transmise", "t": 15.21}, {"w": "principalement", "t": 15.709}, {"w": "par", "t": 16.542}, {"w": "la", "t": 16.709}, {"w": "piqûre", "t": 16.875}, {"w": "d'un", "t": 17.375}, {"w": "moustique", "t": 17.541}, {"w": "infecté", "t": 18.041}, {"w": "du", "t": 18.541}, {"w": "genre", "t": 18.707}, {"w": "Aedes.", "t": 19.04}]}, {"id": "s2b", "scene": 2, "text": "Ces moustiques peuvent piquer pendant la journée.", "start": 19.654, "end": 21.935, "words": [{"w": "Ces", "t": 19.654}, {"w": "moustiques", "t": 19.829}, {"w": "peuvent", "t": 20.356}, {"w": "piquer", "t": 20.707}, {"w": "pendant", "t": 21.058}, {"w": "la", "t": 21.409}, {"w": "journée.", "t": 21.584}]}, {"id": "s3a", "scene": 3, "text": "Les signes à surveiller sont une forte fièvre, des maux de tête, des douleurs derrière les yeux, des douleurs musculaires et articulaires, des nausées ou parfois des éruptions cutanées.", "start": 22.565, "end": 32.21, "words": [{"w": "Les", "t": 22.565}, {"w": "signes", "t": 22.761}, {"w": "à", "t": 23.153}, {"w": "surveiller", "t": 23.349}, {"w": "sont", "t": 23.938}, {"w": "une", "t": 24.134}, {"w": "forte", "t": 24.526}, {"w": "fièvre,", "t": 24.918}, {"w": "des", "t": 25.31}, {"w": "maux", "t": 25.476}, {"w": "de", "t": 25.642}, {"w": "tête,", "t": 25.808}, {"w": "des", "t": 26.14}, {"w": "douleurs", "t": 26.337}, {"w": "derrière", "t": 26.733}, {"w": "les", "t": 27.325}, {"w": "yeux,", "t": 27.523}, {"w": "des", "t": 27.72}, {"w": "douleurs", "t": 27.88}, {"w": "musculaires", "t": 28.2}, {"w": "et", "t": 28.84}, {"